  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It would be nice if there was a Swipe-Type keyboard for VRChat.\nAs VR headsets have a limited motion system, I looked at cellphones that have a similar issue: typing.\nPhones have solved this and increased the speed at which you can type with Swipe Keyboards Such as G-Board.\nIf paired with an ingame tablet of sorts to act as a display, it could greatly improve the speed and quality of text communication. Invites or Showing text for mute players would be faster and more intuitive without breaking immersion. Having to Peck Slowly at a keyboard for five minutes for a single sentence is a massive hassle.\nThis entire Suggestion was written using G-Board from my phone.",
